Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:28.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《异形魔怪》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:06.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（完美市）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:20.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（张华特杂货店）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:51.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密西根大学设备）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:44.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（张氏出租公司 化粪池抽水机）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（厄尔贝斯特与小瓦麦基的家）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:01.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（离开完美山谷）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.62,0:26:38.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（与蛇合照 只要3元）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.55,0:56:03.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（乌兹冲锋枪保护你）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 贝斯特先生 起床时间到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mr. Basset. This is your wake-up call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快清醒吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please move your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛群狂奔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stampede!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛群狂奔 厄尔 快逃 快逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stampede, Earl! Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dumb shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还真遇过牛群狂奔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a stampede once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百头牛拼命地奔跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}300 head going hell-bent for the horizon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.26,0:01:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,厄尔 到底怎样才叫牛群狂奔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly how many cows are required for a stampede, Earl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,三头牛还是更多头牛？有最低速限吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, is it like three or more? Is there a minimum speed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望牛群踢烂你屁股{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish a stampede up your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No breakfast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天是我煮的 我们吃了香肠和豆子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it yesterday. It was bologna and beans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是 昨天吃蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It was eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我煮的荷包蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did eggs over easy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.51,0:02:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你煮个头 明明就是香肠和豆子 今天换你煮了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell you did. Bologna and beans. It's your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我到了你这把年纪 也会不记得吃过什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess when I'm your age…I'll forget what I eat, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你 这工作是给聪明人做的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you, is this a job for intelligent men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个聪明人来 我就问他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me one. I'll ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 若真的想赚钱 就不该再做临时工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we were serious about money, we'd quit being hired hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是杂工 厄尔 我们是杂工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handymen, Earl. We are handymen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.69,0:03:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们不该做这种工作 而是找份真正的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should quit this job…and find ourselves some real employment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想放弃遣份自由吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to give up all this personal freedom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,上快速道路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天要做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on the agenda for today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收垃圾 - 哦 老天 又到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's garbage day. - Man! Already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳斯特付我们多少钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Nestor paying us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,50元 比我们手头上的钱多47元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}$50. And that's $47 more than we got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特和海瑟比较近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt and Heather's place is closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天先帮他们做 明天再收垃圾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do their linoleum today and the garbage tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳斯特明天不在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nestor's not home tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.97,0:03:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不去 就拿不到钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't dig today, we're not paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 瓦蓝提 你做事从不事先计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Valentine, you never plan ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不放眼未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never take the long view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是星期一 我已经在为星期三做打算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is Monday and I'm already thinking of Wednesday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是星期一 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Monday, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 那是谁啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是那个什么研究生吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the grad student?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 他毕业了 一定是新来的 - 新来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. He graduated. Must be the new one. - The new one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是个女生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's supposed to be a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有着金色长发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have long, blonde hair…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色大眼睛 世界级大胸部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}big green eyes, world-class breasts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘翘的屁股 修长的美腿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ass that won't quit and legs that go all the way up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是兰达蕾贝克 这学期来这里做研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi! I'm Rhonda LeBeck. I'm up here for the semester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是哦 研究地理学 - 是地质学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, geography. - Geology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上是地震学 研究地震{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually seismology. Earthquakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:05:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩一定是厄尔和小瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two must be Val and Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听说了很多你们的事 - 我们什么都不承认哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've heard all about you. - We deny everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 听着 我想请教一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a question for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知不知道有人在附近钻孔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know if anybody's doing any drilling or blasting…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或爆破之类吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anything like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近吗？没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around here? No, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.18,0:05:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在监视地震仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to monitor the seismographs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,地震仪能测量震动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they measure vibrations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自地面的震动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibrations in the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直收到一些很奇怪的读数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been getting some really strange readings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年前学校把这些机器放在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The school's had the machines here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从没测到过像这样的记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we've never recorded anything like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会问问看是否有人听说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll ask around. See if anyone's heard anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望机器没故障 否则我整学期都泡汤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I hope they're not broken. I might have to bag the whole semester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 很抱歉打扰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, sorry to bother you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你 希望你能把一切理出头绪来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice meeting you. Hope you get it all sorted out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想的话 我们可以帮她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanted, we could take a look at those…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查地震仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}seismographs for her if you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对地震仪了解多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do we know about seismographs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是接近她最好的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be a slick way to get to know her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.61,0:06:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 小瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Valentine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非从头到脚都合乎你的标准 否则你根本不瞧一眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't go for any gal unless she fits your list, top to bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 对 你比我屁股还蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well sure! - It's dumber than my hind end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像芭比琳谭丝特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, like that…Bobby Lynn Dexter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谭米琳芭丝特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tammy Lynn Baxter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么差 她们都一样麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It don't matter. They're all the same. Dead weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.03,0:06:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「哦 我指甲断了」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, I broke a nail!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看了都起鸡皮疙瘩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes my skin crawl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这环境下的受害者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a victim of circumstance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你在说你老二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you call it your pecker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 大饼脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza-face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.81,0:07:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文 敢碰那辆卡车 就死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melvin You touch that truck and die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老天 吓死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm really shaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 华特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Walter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是中空子弹 但不是海卓沙克中空子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are hollow points, but not hydro-shock hollow points.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我想子弹就是子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullets are bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 各位 近来如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, guys. What's doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遇到新来的研究生兰娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran into that new college student, that Rona.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是兰达 她的机器出了点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhonda. She's having trouble with her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后那些大学生 会在这里发现石油或铀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those college kids turn up oil or uranium or something out there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦官员就会出现在门口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}next thing the Feds will be at our door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.49,0:08:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说 「抱歉 请搬家 这里归政府所有」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sorry. Time to move. Eminent domain."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别激动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down, honey. Down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 柏特 你这么杞人忧天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Burt. The way you worry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三次世界大战都还没打 就先得心脏病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll get a heart attack before you get a chance to survive World War III.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们听 轴承快坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, listen. Bearing going out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是不是？ - 可能吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think? - Could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿再帮你看看 我们还有别的活要赶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, Chang. We got a schedule to keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们凡事都先规划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. See, we plan ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在什么事都不做 厄尔这么跟我说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way we don't do anything right now. Earl explained it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杯鸡尾酒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cocktail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.69,0:10:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人比我们更会处理垃圾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody handles garbage better than we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 厄尔 这工作太低贱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Earl. This is low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.83,0:10:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把眼光放高点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have got to set our sights a little bit higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 马文 你怎么不帮帮忙 多半是你拉的屎尿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melvin, why don't you give us a hand? Most of this shit is yours anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 去店里帮我买六罐啤酒 我付钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, run to the store and pick me up a six-pack. I'll pay for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小于 未成年不能喝啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, beer is for adults.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是没有计划 我们才会一直做这种工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not having a plan is what keeps us doing jobs like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为这种工作 才让我们永远落人之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doing jobs like this is you dragging your feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟敢公然地站在那里对我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to stand there and tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我让咱们滞留在完美市？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the reason we're still in Perfection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我差点就离开这里了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how close I am to leaving this place right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,少胡扯了 哪有差点？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call that little bluff. How close?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可恶 - 混帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! - Goddamn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 真该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ! Goddamn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了带电视机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget the TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你带吸尘器干嘛？ - 我喜欢吸尘器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why you bringing the vacuum cleaner? - I like this vacuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你用不上的 - 至少零件会用得上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You never use it. - It's good for parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你有想过吗？我们可能会请个女佣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, maybe we'll hire a maid. You think about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们两个 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 南茜 我们不再运送木柴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Nancy. We're not delivering firewood anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要去毕斯比定居 - 哦 是哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're heading for Bixby permanent. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 你是说真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. You really are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 敏蒂 跳第几下了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy, what's the count?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,六百四十下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}640.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不需要木柴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need firewood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接到大订单 必须建造新窑烧陶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this big order to fill and have to build my pottery kiln.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.37,0:12:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这工作至少能做一个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it'll be at least a month's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.71,0:12:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提供午餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll throw in lunches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.64,0:12:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 我们对免费啤酒说不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe we said no to free beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们办到了 面对诱惑却不动摇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it! We faced temptation and did not bend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈的 感谢上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn! Praise the Lord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没有任何东西 能阻止我们前往毕斯比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there's nothing, and I mean nothing, between us and Bixby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.07,0:12:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看看那家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.47,0:13:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,和电有关的工作 我绝不做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one job I'd never do. Working around electricity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是艾格迪姆斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Edgar Deems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.65,0:13:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只穿那件夹克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He only wears that one damn jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.32,0:13:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说是他没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him, I'm telling you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 他这次肯定喝醉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sure must've been drunk this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格 快给我下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your butt down from there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能把他留在上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave him up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是谢了 艾格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Edgar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我一次 你这老酒鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me on this one, you damned old boozehound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 你得被送去戒酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these days, you'll have to get your ass on a wagon and stay there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 当我闲着没事做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I don't have better things to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只好爬电塔拉你下来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than climb towers and drag your hairy ass down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 是心脏病发作吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it a heart attack, doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.53,0:14:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是脱水而死的 口渴死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died of dehydration. Thirst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也没道理 要渴死也得花好几天 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't make any sense. That takes a couple of days, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能要三或四天吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even three or four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意思是他坐在那里三或四天？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean he sat up there three or four days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在那里直到渴死？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sat up there and just died of thirst?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他比我们更恨完美市吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You reckon he hated Perfection more than us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他想自杀吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you suppose he wanted to kill himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有人追他 他才不下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody must've chased him up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说有人不怕来福枪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean someone that ain't scared of a Winchester rifle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.27,0:16:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what'd they do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下面扎营 等他渴死？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camp out and wait for him to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 弗瑞德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里 老弗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there, Old Fred!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 弗瑞德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Fred!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗瑞德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred? Fred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奇怪了 - 真是奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is weird. - This is real weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 到底怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus! - What the hell's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快离开这里 附近有个杀人狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here! There's a killer on the loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 凶手 一个真正的疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - A murderer, man! A real psycho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把人头切下来 我不是开玩笑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cutting people's heads off. I'm not kidding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在耍我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're pulling our chain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:17:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍尔 霍尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡麦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carmine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁干的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who could be doing it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.13,0:18:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在指控任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not accusing anybody, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.93,0:18:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是告诉你 我的一些牛不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but saying some of my cattle are missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说真的？老弗死了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious? Old Fred's dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.27,0:18:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在鬼扯 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bullshitting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗瑞德怎么了？ - 比艾格更惨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to Fred? - Worse than Edgar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗瑞德怎么了？ - 你们不会相信的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to him? - You won't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要买条糖果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a candy bar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 电话坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this. The phone's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.28,0:18:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 华特 你的电话坏了 - 我没动它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walter, your phone is dead! - I didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳斯特 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nestor, what's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人杀了老弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody killed old Fred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瓦 你们得去毕斯比找警察来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Val, you've got to get to Bixby, and get the police up here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}.And step on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it stepped on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就差晚了一天决定离开这鬼地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We decided to leave this place one damn day too late, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没有任何事能阻止我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's sure as hell nothing to stop us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.85,0:19:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里到毕斯比的路上 我们认识的人全都死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody we know between here and Bixby is already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是老天爷在惩罚我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there some higher force at work here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对人生有要求过多吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, are we asking too much of life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙跑哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are these guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.23,0:19:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在做什么？爆破吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing? Blasting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在哪？这哪像在修路啊 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you guys? It's not like there's another road, assholes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瓦 小瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Val? Val!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 真不敢相信 - 你让车卡住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus! I don't believe this! - You're hung up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 车卡住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hung up, I tell you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.42,0:20:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把离合器烧坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to burn the clutch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样开会把车辆给弄断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could break an axle like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能闭嘴？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you shut up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不要在这里过夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to spend the night out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱哭鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crybaby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会是土狼吗？ - 不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could it have been coyotes? - No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,土狼不会切了弗瑞德的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coyotes didn't kill Fred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小瓦和厄尔来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Val and Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不应该在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shouldn't be here already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.99,0:21:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你们到毕斯比了 - 你们绝不会相信的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thought you two were in Bixby by now. - You're won't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈 - 哦 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柏特 小心点 - 不会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burt, be careful. - Unreal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们从哪弄来的？ - 我并不知道它在车底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you get it? - I didn't know we had it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.47,0:21:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真恶心 - 是蛇吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's disgusting. - Some kind of snake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看更像只鳗鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more like an eel to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,鳗鱼住在水里 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eels live in the water, don't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许是蛞蝓妈妈 - 别碰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big mother slug, maybe. - Don't touch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.81,0:21:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 它死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. It's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时一定是被它抓住 所以车子才动不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must've grabbed us! That's why the truck stalled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我说我没卡住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I wasn't hung up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这东西让你们的车动不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stalled out your truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定是个力气很大的畜牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd have to be one strong son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:21:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也很臭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stinks, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用5元跟你买{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you boys $5 for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,20元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}$20.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 10元 - 15元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, $10! - $15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.32,0:22:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 15元 - 没错 15元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, $15. - Damn right, $15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.49,0:22:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是条蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be a snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.83,0:22:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生突变的蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of mutation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.47,0:22:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管它是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,单单一只没法吃掉弗瑞德 以及全部的羊群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just one of these couldn't eat up Fred and his whole flock of sheep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你认为那里还有更多只？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think there are more out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.23,0:22:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,累死我了 这些留着明天早上再弄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead. Let's put this stuff up in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.60,0:22:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明早要去毕斯比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go to Bixby in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:23:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 煤渣砖送来了 - 哦 煤渣砖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The cinder blocks are in. - The cinder blocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.27,0:23:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这美丽的天空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep looking at that beautiful sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.61,0:23:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等房子盖好后 这片天空将天天照耀着我们的屋顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the sky that'll be over our roof every night when we're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.35,0:23:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不盖屋顶呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we don't finish the roof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.45,0:23:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就能一直享受这片天空 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can look at the sky all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.06,0:23:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 又是那鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That damn thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们该买个新的发电机吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time we buy a new generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.95,0:23:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫它不见了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, it's gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.65,0:23:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定它本来在这儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is where it was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.66,0:23:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这里没错 这里有电线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was right here! There's the cord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能陷进去了 这附近有很多矿坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the ground caved in. There's mines and stuff around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.34,0:24:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别拉了 你不想掉进去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't then. You don't want to fall in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.45,0:24:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.18,0:24:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 什么东西那么臭？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, what is that stink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.19,0:24:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.09,0:24:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 咱们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.66,0:24:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快回镇上 拜托 吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go back to town or something. Please, Jim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.53,0:24:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是地质之类的关系 比如天然气或喷泉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a geological thing like natural gas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有这种臭味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a geyser. They stink like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.51,0:24:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得黄石公园吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember in Yellowstone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西抓住我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's got me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.04,0:24:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 吉姆 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jim, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西把我往下拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's got me down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.48,0:24:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.29,0:24:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.99,0:24:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找东西来 把我拉上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get something. Get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.86,0:25:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh! Jim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.47,0:25:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西抓住我 哦 天啊 拜托救我出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's got me. Please get me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.81,0:25:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.54,0:25:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.60,0:25:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.93,0:26:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂 笑一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy, smile. Honey, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 亲爱的 别那么害怕 它不会伤害你的 我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look so afraid. It won't hurt you. I promise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.30,0:26:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 敏蒂 看这里 笑一下 - 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mindy look up. Smile. - must{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.33,0:26:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.43,0:26:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文 滚开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melvin, get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.61,0:26:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老张真是机灵 我没说错吧 - 只卖可恶的15元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Old Chang, slick as snot, and I ain't lying. - A lousy $15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.34,0:26:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个会事先规划的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who plans ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.67,0:27:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们要自我防卫 设立阵线 轮流守卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We arm ourselves, we set perimeters, we stand guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.85,0:27:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要那些蛇出现 我们就把它们灭绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of those snake things show up here, we make them extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.36,0:27:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 拜托 柏特 你太紧张了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right! - Burt, get serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.03,0:27:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你搞得像在打仗一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! You make it sound like a war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.60,0:27:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些人干嘛排斥事先防御？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What've you got against being prepared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.53,0:27:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糖在哪？ - 又一个蓝波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is the sugar? - Rambo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.93,0:27:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 华特有无线通讯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter's got a CB radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.87,0:27:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不和毕斯比市联络？找警察来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you calling Bixby? The police…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 因为那些山 无线讯号出不了山谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no We can't reach outside the valley because of the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.87,0:27:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文 你是下一个 快坐下 假装很害怕的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're next. Sit down, look scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.09,0:27:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.01,0:27:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话坏了 路也断了 只能靠自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The phone's out. The road's out. We're on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.88,0:27:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩最喜欢这样 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are just loving it, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.12,0:27:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 南茜 别针对个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, don't get personal about this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.35,0:27:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得做些准备 - 对 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've got to do something. - Hell, yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.52,0:27:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全被隔绝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are completely cut off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.69,0:27:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,北边是峭壁 东西面是高山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the cliffs to the north, mountains to the east and the west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.66,0:27:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是海瑟和我在这里定居的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Heather and me settled here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.83,0:27:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,地形上完全孤立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geographic isolation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.83,0:27:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定还有别的求救方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a way we can get help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.14,0:27:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可不是月球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the moon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.37,0:28:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么做 走60公里的路到毕斯比求救？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do, walk the 38 miles to Bixby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.57,0:28:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特有鞍马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Walter's saddle horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.41,0:28:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要拍了 随你们使用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. You're welcome to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.88,0:28:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有人骑去毕斯比市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody could ride to Bixby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.82,0:28:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.59,0:28:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁最会骑马？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's best on a horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.04,0:28:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特 它们最好能跑得很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They better be fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.07,0:28:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不想被那些怪兽困住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to be stuck on a couple of canners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.17,0:28:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些蛇怪速度没那么快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those snakes couldn't travel that fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.21,0:28:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道个屁 它们可能还会飞呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all you know they could fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.54,0:28:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要哪一个？手枪还是艾格的来福枪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want? This Colt or Edgar's old rifle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.11,0:28:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来福枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.62,0:28:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,厄尔 追里有一些乳酪和子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's some Swiss cheese and bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.36,0:28:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 华特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.46,0:29:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？ - 准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You guys all set? - Ready as we'll ever be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.70,0:29:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟和我开车逛逛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather and I drive around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.97,0:29:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看是否能找到那个大学女孩 叫她回镇上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to find that college girl, tell her to get her ass back into town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.27,0:29:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意 我们会顺路去找医生 看他们是否去了毕斯比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea. We'll stop by the doctor's place and see if they went into Bixby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.41,0:29:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.81,0:29:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得带火力更强的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take something that packs more of a punch than that.30-30{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.98,0:29:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不带我们的自动步枪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take one of our Browning autos?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.98,0:29:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是更好的 我的70型自动枪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or better than that. Take my Model 70?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.75,0:29:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是点375自动连发枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's.375 "H and H" mag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.32,0:29:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 海瑟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Heather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.42,0:29:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不会用到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we don't need to use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.56,0:29:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它抓住我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got me! It's got me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.15,0:29:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,成熟点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grow up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.19,0:29:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 马文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.17,0:29:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他只是开玩笑 - 你差点就没命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's only kidding. - You came that close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.84,0:29:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,差一点点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.18,0:29:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.92,0:29:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文 你总有一天会被痛扁一顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these days somebody's going to kick your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.06,0:30:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.14,0:30:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 我真恨那鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.71,0:30:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.58,0:30:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子不在 我们只是错过他们而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car's gone. We just missed them, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.86,0:31:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那首老歌从哪传出来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the goddamn golden oldie coming from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.07,0:31:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么鬼东西？ - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell's this? - You got me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.92,0:31:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 计划是这样 我们连停都不停 快速地跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the plan. We don't even stop. We ride like hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.96,0:31:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上也不休息 牵着马走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight we'll keep right on going. We'll walk the horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.96,0:31:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.34,0:31:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 究竟是什么鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are those things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.80,0:31:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把整部车埋起来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could they bury a station wagon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.87,0:31:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们为何这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.11,0:31:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 小子 快点 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, git!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.78,0:31:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特不知道一匹好马 在它不听话时就要扁它屁股{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter wouldn't know a decent horse if it bit him in the ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.41,0:32:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 它们可能感受到一些不安的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. They got wind of something they don't like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.78,0:32:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Git.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.75,0:32:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不太对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.26,0:32:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything anywhere!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.33,0:32:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 嘿 你还好吗？ - 我的马呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah. What about my horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.64,0:32:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the name of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.35,0:32:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来它们躲在地底下 窜出来抓你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how they get you. They're under the goddamn ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.35,0:32:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们到底是什么东西？ - 狗娘养的畜牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are they? - Sons of bitches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.60,0:32:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有很多只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a million of them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.00,0:32:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 只有一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Just one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.64,0:33:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.40,0:33:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在追我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gaining on us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.01,0:33:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.48,0:33:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定办得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.76,0:33:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋畜牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.49,0:33:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它把自己撞昏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It knocked itself cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.40,0:33:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是撞昏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold, my ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.93,0:34:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是撞死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.57,0:34:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We killed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.94,0:34:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We killed it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.61,0:34:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.28,0:34:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 各位 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.38,0:34:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一分钟前 有没有发现什么奇怪的事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice anything weird a minute ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.79,0:34:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it just happened…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.03,0:34:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.73,0:34:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 数到三 一起用力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, together. One, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.07,0:34:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.47,0:34:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是死了才那么臭？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it smell like that because it's dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.99,0:34:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see any eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.42,0:34:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是生存在地底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be totally subterranean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.66,0:35:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是触角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those tentacles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.33,0:35:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们把触角从嘴里射出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think they shoot right out of its mouth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.67,0:35:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,钩住你 然后再拉回嘴里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they hook you and pull you right in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.34,0:35:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我们在它杀更多人之前 制止了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing we stopped it before it killed anybody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.79,0:35:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is important, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.08,0:35:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这像是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.62,0:35:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, let's just say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.52,0:35:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可能是这世纪以来 动物学上最大的发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is probably the biggest zoological discovery of the century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.42,0:35:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey. Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.09,0:35:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到这混蛋的尾巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found the ass end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.26,0:35:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 我们真的抓到大怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, we really caught something here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.01,0:35:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow! - Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.31,0:35:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可真大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one big mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.18,0:35:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定就是这老怪物 让你的地震仪不停地工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be the old boy had your seismos working overtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.38,0:35:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.05,0:35:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定是利用这些东西来行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must push itself along with these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.79,0:36:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当全部一起动时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them pushing at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.32,0:36:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就能移动得这么快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it moved so fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.79,0:36:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意全身都是感应器 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean This thing had sensors tripping all over the place. No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.00,0:36:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰达 你听说过像这样的玩意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhonda, you ever heard of anything like this before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.57,0:36:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 厄尔 大家都听过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh sure. Everybody knows about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.53,0:36:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是没人告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just didn't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.07,0:36:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡扯 没人见过这种怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, man, no one ever saw anything like this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.01,0:36:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挖到一些宝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're really onto something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.07,0:36:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.51,0:36:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,老张别想再用15元买下它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}old Chang don't get his slick mitts on this for no measly $15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.35,0:36:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.05,0:36:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 计划是这样的 我们需要一个拖板车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here's the plan. We need a flatbed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.72,0:36:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 还要一个绞盘 - 大约能举起4 5公吨重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right, with a winch. - A five- ton maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.82,0:36:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不能用绞盘 它会把它撕裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't want a winch. It'd tear it all up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.76,0:36:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 起重机呢？ - 对 起重机有吊带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A crane? - Yeah, a crane with lifting straps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.43,0:36:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.83,0:36:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算了算 这附近还有三只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are three more of these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.06,0:36:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.43,0:36:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有三只？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.57,0:36:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在整个山谷放了地震仪 如果把不同的读数做个比较{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got seismographs all over the valley. Compare the readings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.87,0:36:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天下午两点这里有一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's one at 2:00 yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.91,0:36:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是同个时间近5公里处还有一只 这样就是两只了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's one three miles away at the exact time. That's two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.08,0:36:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这里 - 对 我们相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But here… - We'll take your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.11,0:37:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的卡车呢？ - 在山坡后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, where's your truck? - Just beyond that hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.05,0:37:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.53,0:37:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 臭土拨鼠挖的洞 - 小畜牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn prairie dog burrow. - Little sons of bitches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.61,0:37:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.91,0:37:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,到石头上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up on that rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.83,0:37:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来就是它抓住我们的卡车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the one that got our truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.83,0:37:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的车到底在哪？ - 就在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell's your truck? - Right over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.24,0:37:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我想我们过不去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we can make that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.94,0:38:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少它不会爬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least he can't climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.75,0:38:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew. Oh, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.02,0:38:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,活的比死的还臭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live ones smell worse than the dead ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.81,0:38:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.61,0:38:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们一定是辐射造成突变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're mutations caused by radiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.61,0:38:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.04,0:38:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是政府制造出来 要送给俄国人的一个大惊喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government built them. Big surprise for the Russians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.95,0:38:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定在化石纪录里 没有和它们类似的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing like them in the fossil record. I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.49,0:38:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它们是在化石纪录前就有的生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, they predate the fossil record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.72,0:38:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说它们几十亿年前就存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would make them a couple billion years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.73,0:38:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们直到今天才看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've just never seen one untill now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.73,0:38:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.07,0:39:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为是外星物种 不可能是地球土生土长的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I vote for outer space. No way these are local boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.07,0:39:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经好几小时没动静了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, haven't seen a sign for hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.51,0:39:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一定跑远了 - 对 一定是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Must be long gone. - Yeah, must be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.92,0:39:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下去走走不就知道了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take a little stroll and find out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.59,0:39:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.04,0:39:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们得试试」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We've got to do something."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.04,0:39:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不懂为什么每次「我们」 最后都变成「我」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why "we" always has to be "me" every damn time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.94,0:39:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我长得像什么？虫虫专家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, we, we. What do I look like? An expert on worms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.28,0:39:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小瓦 两公尺内它都钩得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, it's got a good six-foot reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.62,0:39:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 厄尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Earl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.05,0:39:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.96,0:39:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死得畜牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a goddamn bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.63,0:39:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉说粗话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon my French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.79,0:40:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 它一直在这里等？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! It's been waiting here all this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.73,0:40:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它怎么知道我们还在这儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it know we're still here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.47,0:40:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没眼睛吧？在地底下也闻不到我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got no eyes, right? Sure as hell can't smell us underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.20,0:40:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说一定是用听的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.47,0:40:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.04,0:40:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能感受到地面的震动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It senses seismic vibration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.71,0:40:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是在这石头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can hear every move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一举一动它都听得到 因为石头是个导体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we make on this rock. It's a perfect conductor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.22,0:40:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是我们被困住了 我快疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means we're stuck. That pisses me off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.66,0:40:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌没教养 但我得方便一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to be crude, but I've got to take care of business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.07,0:40:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me, too. - Same here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.36,0:41:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.17,0:41:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. Anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.38,0:41:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么计划？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.78,0:41:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我们得看看 那老家伙还在不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first thing we've got to do is see if old Stumpy's still out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.56,0:41:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 铲子借一下？ - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I borrow that shovel? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.07,0:41:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道它无家可归？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't he have a home to go to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.34,0:41:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以艾格才不肯离开电塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Edgar never got down off that damn tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.12,0:41:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.52,0:41:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想些办法 不然就得等死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we have to come up with a plan or he's going to wait us to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.98,0:42:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在想 - 何不跑跑看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was thinking… - Why not run?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.85,0:42:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们昨天就跑赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We outran him yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.48,0:42:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑？跑并不是计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run for it? Running's not a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.63,0:42:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑是计划失败后的下下策{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running's what you do when a plan fails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.59,0:42:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瓦 你根本没动脑想计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not trying to think of a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.82,0:42:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们并没有多少选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't like we got a hell of a lot of options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.02,0:42:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,永逮都有选择 只要努力地想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always options. We've just got to think of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.33,0:42:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你就开始想吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you start thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.40,0:42:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何一直都是我在伤脑筋？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I always have to do all the thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.90,0:42:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让你成为爱因斯坦啊 - 你们会撑竿跳吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who died and made you Einstein? - You know how to pole vault?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.11,0:42:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要跳到它抓不到的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just stay where he can't get us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.51,0:42:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳到这些大石头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on these residual boulders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.28,0:42:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车就停在另一边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My truck's parked next to one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.89,0:42:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要跳到石头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on those residual boulders!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.13,0:42:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个谭米琳芭丝特会撑竿跳吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Tammy Lynn Baxter, she do much pole vaulting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.28,0:43:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.06,0:43:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不赖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.11,0:43:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦跳到卡车 那家伙不会给我们太多时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That slimebag won't give us much time once we hit that truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.18,0:43:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得一起跳 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I say we all jump together. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.09,0:43:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.82,0:43:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.93,0:43:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.54,0:44:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.61,0:44:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, Val!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.38,0:44:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.39,0:44:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来帮我一下吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can somebody, perhaps, help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.45,0:44:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.49,0:44:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,像蛇一样的东西只是它的舌头之类的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The snake things are just their tongues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.97,0:44:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些怪物很庞大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These animals are huge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.67,0:44:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我觉得很不安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm having a real difficult time with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.67,0:44:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你们快回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you guys, answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.58,0:44:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快回来 - 嘿 华特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, you - guys, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.01,0:44:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柏特和海瑟去哪了？ - 我连络不上他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Burt and Heather? - I can't reach them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.91,0:44:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他们还开着车到处看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess they're still driving around somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.05,0:44:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 兰达 那些东西叫什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the name you call those things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.92,0:44:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们从哪来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do they come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.59,0:44:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你是个科学家 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - You're a scientist, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.26,0:45:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有套理论之类的吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you supposed to have a theory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.43,0:45:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这些生物从没被发现过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These creatures are absolutely unprecedented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.16,0:45:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但它们从哪来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah. But where do they come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.37,0:45:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.37,0:45:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们从哪来的并不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter where they come from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.24,0:45:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有名字吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.84,0:45:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现的 就该替它命名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We discovered them, we should name them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.58,0:45:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特 别想什么命名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the damn name!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.28,0:45:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和厄尔认为最好离开山谷去求援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now me and Earl need to get out of this valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.78,0:45:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 小瓦 先别冲动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. Let's not go off half-cocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.21,0:45:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 一旦有人发现路不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's bound to come check on us once they see the road is out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.05,0:45:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 电话也不通时 就会派人来找我们 - 对 说得没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and the lines are down. - That's how it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.68,0:45:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是「舌怪」「舌蟒」 - 我喜欢蛇蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Suckoids." - "Oids." I like "snakeoids."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.65,0:46:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一靠近 我就用2公斤多的锄头敲死它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them comes near me and I'll hit him with a five-pound pickax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.49,0:46:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解 纳斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.99,0:46:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是从地底下窜出来偷袭你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come up from the ground and grab you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.23,0:46:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们能感应到地面的震动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sense the slightest vibration through the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.66,0:46:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连脚步声也能感应 它们就是追样猎食的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even footsteps. That's how they hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.73,0:46:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就不能动 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we don't vibrate, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.84,0:46:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许它们根本不会来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they won't even come through here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.41,0:46:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许也不会骚扰我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they'll leave us alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.57,0:46:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用电锯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chain saw. That's what I'll use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.81,0:46:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 醒醒吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey. hey. hey, Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.35,0:46:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.85,0:46:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们正朝着我们来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're headed right for us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.15,0:46:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们把艾格困在这里 老弗则死在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They trapped Edgar here. Grabbed old Fred right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.26,0:46:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路上吃了那两个可怜的工人 而医生则死在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nailed those two poor suckers on the road and the doctor's place is here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.50,0:46:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这整个山谷都是它的点心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This valley is just one long smorgasbord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.97,0:46:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have got to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.04,0:46:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get Mindy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.64,0:46:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 她没事 我看到她在街上玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's okay. I saw her playing down the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.81,0:47:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢「霸王蟒」 就用这名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I like, "Graboids"! That's it, "graboids"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.11,0:47:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 华特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Walter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.85,0:47:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不替它命名 我们一定会很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to be sorry if we don't give it a name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.72,0:47:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 小瓦 你要我们离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you say let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.89,0:47:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们该去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we supposed to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.32,0:47:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰达有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhonda's got an idea about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.96,0:47:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在新生代冲积岩来去自如{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, they move very easily through the Pleistocene alluvials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.53,0:47:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是泥土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.80,0:47:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个山谷都由松软的泥土覆盖而成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The loose soil that covers the valley floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.07,0:47:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们无法穿过岩石区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they can't move through rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.07,0:47:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我认为应该朝西走向山区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go west to the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.07,0:47:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是指旧得吉普车道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She means up the old Jeep trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.74,0:47:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果整座山都是坚硬的花岗岩 我们就安全了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If those mountains are granite we'd be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.24,0:47:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以一路走到毕斯比 如果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could hike along them to Bixby if we…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.68,0:47:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吓到你了 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I scared you, didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.99,0:47:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little ass wipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.76,0:47:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若不住手 就和这颗他妈的球一起滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't knock it off, you're going to be shitting this basketball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.03,0:47:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉又说粗话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon my French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.67,0:47:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.17,0:47:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.91,0:48:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和纳斯特一起 就得多花好几天才能找到救兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to take us days to get back with help with Nestor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.78,0:48:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会抛下你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to leave you alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.05,0:48:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可恶 我要踢烂他的屁股 - 我去帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it! I'm going to kick his ass! - I'm going to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.79,0:48:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melvin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.72,0:48:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小混帐呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that little shit stain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.03,0:48:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文 给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melvin, get your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.10,0:48:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去 进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.65,0:48:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑 快点 - 快点 进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run! Come on! - Come on, get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.82,0:48:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 华特 你有枪吗？ - 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walter, you got a gun? - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.33,0:48:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么办？ - 安静 安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we going to do? - Be quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.23,0:49:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.02,0:49:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在记住 别出声 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now remember, no noise, no vibrations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.13,0:49:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mindy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.87,0:49:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.17,0:49:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂 下来 别玩弹簧高跷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy, get off the pogo stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.44,0:49:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.68,0:49:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小瓦 去叫她 - 敏蒂 回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her, Val! - Mindy, come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.45,0:49:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.46,0:50:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 敏蒂 - 安静 安静 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be quiet. - Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.80,0:50:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂 退后 退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy, get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.17,0:50:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 进屋里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Get in the house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.04,0:50:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去救他 它会把整部车拉下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him off or it'll suck that truck down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.38,0:50:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在老天份上 快回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back, for Chrissake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.69,0:50:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 又来一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, here comes another one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.56,0:50:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.72,0:51:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把裤子脱掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of your pants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.26,0:51:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.47,0:51:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.84,0:52:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 别回头 快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look back. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.96,0:52:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.72,0:52:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰达 这些给你 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rhonda, here. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.46,0:52:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办？它们多久才会离开？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do? How long untill they go away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.33,0:52:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们很有耐心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got the patience of Job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.00,0:52:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,会一直等下去 直到听到像是午餐的东西出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sit and wait until they hear something that sounds like lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.24,0:52:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得想个计划 - 我有个计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've got to have a plan. - I got a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.04,0:53:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和小瓦开车到山里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive the truck up to the mountain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.41,0:53:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,走到毕斯比求援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}walk to Bixby, get some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.98,0:53:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特 那些怪物吃了我们的卡车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those scumsuckers ate our radials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.58,0:53:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以开我的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take my truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.55,0:53:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们需要四轮传动的车 才能爬吉普车道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we need a major four-wheel drive just to get up that Jeep trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.09,0:53:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条路崎岖不平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That trail's all messed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.06,0:53:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.76,0:53:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉开 拉开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.44,0:53:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.61,0:53:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,手伸过来 手伸过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.06,0:53:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.06,0:54:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.75,0:54:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快走 到屋顶去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go! The roof!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.44,0:54:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.31,0:54:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跳 蔺达 你办得到 - 不 我不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jump! You can do it! - I can't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.49,0:54:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰达 别停 继续跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop. Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.63,0:55:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.80,0:55:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.84,0:55:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.31,0:55:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么回事？你们在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Where are you guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.18,0:55:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？你们在上面干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up? What the hell are you doing up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.45,0:55:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the hell up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.55,0:55:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爬到屋顶上 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up on your roof. - No way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.57,0:55:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳斯特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nestor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.57,0:55:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳斯特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nestor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.04,0:55:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 到屋顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, get up on your roofs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.71,0:55:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到屋顶上 它们会从地板窜出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up on your roofs! They come through the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.02,0:56:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白也不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.49,0:56:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见踪影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.60,0:56:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有征兆 没有踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign. No spoor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.87,0:56:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吃了那么多羊 得去某个地方拉肚子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think after eating all those sheep they'd have to take a dump someplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.77,0:56:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也搞不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I don't understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.53,0:56:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特 我是柏特 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter, this is Burt. Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特？有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter? Anybody copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.20,0:56:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.04,0:56:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 华特 你在吗？请回答 - 好了 我拿到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walter, you there? Come back! - Okay, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.82,0:57:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上 是谁在看店啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's minding the store, for God's sake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.65,0:57:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 柏特 我们知道是什么东西杀了大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, listen. We found out what's been killing people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.62,0:57:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要说「完毕」 - 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say "over." - Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.66,0:57:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,收不到 华特 检查一下频率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative copy on that, Walter. Check your frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.43,0:57:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在22号频道 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on 22. Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.73,0:57:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 听得到吗？完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, can you hear me now? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.97,0:57:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瓦 是你吗？怎么回来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you? What're you doing back already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.17,0:57:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 那边一定出了什么怪事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something real weird's going on over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.51,0:57:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全站在屋顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're up on top of the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.29,0:57:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想它们要去找柏特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're going for Burt's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.70,0:57:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 它们真的去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man! They're going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.60,0:57:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 快离开地下室 带着无线电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, get out of your basement. Take your radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.04,0:58:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快和海瑟爬到屋顶上去 待会再谈好吗？完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Heather get up on your roof. We'll talk later. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.78,0:58:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶？小瓦 你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up on the roof? What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.11,0:58:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 柏特 就听他的 事情不太对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Burt. Listen to him. Something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.78,0:58:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.48,0:58:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快爬到屋顶上去 怪物来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up on your roof! The things!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.72,0:58:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在地底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're under the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,体型比我们想像的还大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bigger than we thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.89,0:58:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们正朝着你们去了 马上就会到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're huge. They're coming after you. They're coming right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.31,0:58:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么也没看到 小瓦 你到底在说什么？完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't see anything. What the hell are you talking about? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.91,0:58:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 它们在地底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're under the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.55,0:58:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们很会挖土 超大的怪物 在地底下行动 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can dig. Big monsters! Underground! Now get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.35,0:58:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.94,0:59:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.15,0:59:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.96,1:00:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹盒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magazine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.19,1:00:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.53,1:01:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,找错对象了吧 你这混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broke into the wrong goddamn rec room, didn't you, you bastard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.37,1:01:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了它 听到了吗？我们杀了那只大肉球 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We killed it! You got that? We killed that motherhumper! Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.08,1:01:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了 柏特 恭喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Burt. And congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.25,1:01:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有两只 重复一次 还有两只大肉球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised, however, there are two more. Repeat, two more motherhumpers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.16,1:01:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特杀了一只 解决了一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt got one! He killed one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.23,1:01:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Way to go, dude! - All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.17,1:01:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.04,1:02:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不能嘲笑柏特的生活方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we don't get to make fun of Burt's lifestyle anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.78,1:02:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, Burt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.01,1:02:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有办法再干掉另外两条吗？请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance you can get the other two? Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.62,1:02:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 老弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One second, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.23,1:02:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是猎枪也射不穿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't get penetration even with the elephant gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.23,1:02:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.20,1:02:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Lord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.47,1:02:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瓦 我们没办法杀它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't get them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.41,1:02:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没想到还得先射穿泥土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never figured on having to shoot through dirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.65,1:02:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算用最好的枪也射不穿泥土 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best goddamn bullet stop there is. Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.28,1:02:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我跟他说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.74,1:02:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 柏特 别再射它们了 告诉我 你能回到车上吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget shooting them. Can you get to your truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.66,1:02:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完毕 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over. - No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.99,1:02:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 只有你的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the only truck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.59,1:02:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,能开上吉普车道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can get up that Jeep trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.06,1:02:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在听好 这是我的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now listen. Here's the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.10,1:02:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和海瑟去求救 往山上开 再一直走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Heather go for help. You get to the mountains and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.31,1:02:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.94,1:02:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come over. - Hang on a sec.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.44,1:03:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又有动静了 - 它好像不是原来那只肥仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's up to something. - If it isn't our old pal Stumpy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.28,1:03:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.02,1:03:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰达 你想它在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think it's trying to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.92,1:03:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛老是问我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you keep asking me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.47,1:03:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞什么 - 搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the - What the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.65,1:03:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底在搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.85,1:03:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫厄尔 你要我们怎么做？请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaker there, Earl. What did you want us to do? Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.89,1:03:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 柏特 这畜牲在搞新花样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Burt. This bastard's trying something new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.53,1:03:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.65,1:04:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们没有出声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wasn't making no noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.08,1:04:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会去找她们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is he bothering them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.08,1:04:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来好像它在研究房子 试着理出头绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like it's studying the buildings, trying to figure them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.42,1:04:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们感受得到我们产生的震动 却又找不到在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can feel our vibrations but they can't find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.66,1:04:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 它们似乎在拟定计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks to me like they're coming up with a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.20,1:04:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 纳斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, Nestor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.91,1:04:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.11,1:04:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 真是受够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.09,1:05:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别待在地上 纳斯特 快走 - 离开那里 离开地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off the ground! Get moving! - Get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.29,1:05:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.63,1:05:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 纳斯特 快点 你得爬高一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's no good! You've got to get higher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.38,1:05:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.31,1:05:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们得想点办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You guys have got to do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.38,1:05:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得想点办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.56,1:05:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 海瑟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt? Heather?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.66,1:05:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 听到了 小瓦 请回答 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got us. Come on back. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.93,1:05:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这边情况不太好 得改变计划才行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in deep shit over here. We'll have to change that plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.67,1:05:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柏特 住手 - 我想我把它吓跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burt, cut it out! - I think I scared him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.51,1:05:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去求救无济于事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No use going for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.68,1:05:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们回来前 我们早就挂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be dead long before you'd ever get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.98,1:05:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 小瓦 就听你的 只要告诉我该怎么做 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok Val We're with you. Tell us what you want to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.28,1:06:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们底下的这些家伙 会把整座城给拆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's going to tear this town out from under us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.69,1:06:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得一起离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to have to get out of here together…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.81,1:06:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在 - 好的 小瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- now. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.62,1:06:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会去接大家 留在那儿等 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming after everybody. Just hang tight. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.63,1:06:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.19,1:06:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瓦 你得放弃卡车计划了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to have to forget about the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.89,1:06:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了 海瑟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we've got you, Heather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.66,1:06:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 情况仍然没变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. The situation hasn't changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.03,1:06:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是得靠石头 一定有些办法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have to make it to solid rock. There's got to be a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.40,1:06:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么办法？我们没有任何工具到得了山区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what? There's nothing left that can make it to those mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.24,1:06:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小瓦 安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.47,1:06:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了 它们知道我们在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter now. They know we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.91,1:07:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 我们需要的是直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a helicopter what we need. Or a goddamn tank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.43,1:07:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或是坦克车 - 等等 等等 推土机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a minute. - The Cat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.25,1:07:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以用推土机吗？ - 老天 它比任何东西都慢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could we take the Cat? - Jesus. It's slower than hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.09,1:07:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但它至少有27公吨重 它们不可能举得起27公吨吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it weighs more than 30 tons. There's no way they could lift that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.49,1:07:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能吗？我是说 - 但我们挤不下一台推土机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could they? I mean… - But we can't all fit on the bulldozer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.17,1:07:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.77,1:07:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过后面可以拖东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but we could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.89,1:07:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖一部车吧 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}drag something, though. We could pull a car behind it. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.01,1:07:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆旧得半拖车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, that old semitrailer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.04,1:07:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它的轮胎没气 - 不要紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Its tires are flat. - Doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.11,1:07:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 推土机什么都能拖 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That Cat can pull anything. - Well all right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.95,1:07:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只要能离开这里 - 我们有个计划了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We just roll on out of here. - We've got a plan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.29,1:07:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 还有一段长路得走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, that's a hell of a long walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.53,1:07:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 它们只对震动有感应 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen They only respond to vibration, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.97,1:07:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 何不分散它们的注意力？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't we distract them somehow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.30,1:07:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.04,1:08:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说用诱饵让它们忙碌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to keep them busy. Like a decoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.31,1:08:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文 要不要赚点钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melvin, you want to make a buck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.11,1:08:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 自己留着用吧 - 牵引机怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eat it! - How about tractor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.57,1:08:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特的小牵引机怎么样？把它发动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about Walter's little tractor? Start him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.55,1:08:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再让它自己走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go out by himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.32,1:08:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,若那些东西喜欢噪音的话 就会跟着它到处走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let those things follow him all over if they like that noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.46,1:08:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赖哦 你觉得呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad. What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.84,1:08:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,愈来愈近了 厄尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground's getting closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.51,1:08:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就照米奎尔的计划做吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go with Miguel's plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.10,1:09:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 南茜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Nancy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.47,1:09:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去发动推土机 - 你别想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm making the run for the Cat. - Like hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.55,1:09:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说真的 厄尔 我跑得比你快 - 但我开得比你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm faster than you. - But I'm best at driving the Cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.54,1:09:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在时就不是 - 该死 听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not while I'm around. - Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.11,1:09:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我比你老又比你聪明 - 对了一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm older and wiser - Well you're half right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.98,1:09:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我输了 我得去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! I lost. Guess I'll have to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.62,1:09:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了 由我决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won. I pick who does it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.52,1:09:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你好了就走 米奎尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready when you are, Miguel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.37,1:09:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在那里 它走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is. There he goes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.08,1:09:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它去追了 它去追了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's chasing it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.58,1:09:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它走了 这只也走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going. This one's going, too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.59,1:10:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运 猪头 - 别担心我 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good luck, shithead. - Don't worry about me, jerk-off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.17,1:10:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.60,1:10:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这自杀狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suicidal son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.46,1:10:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.86,1:10:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天 哦 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh my God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.30,1:10:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.24,1:10:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们去追他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.81,1:10:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瓦 停下来 它们来了 安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Val, stop! They're coming! Be quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.78,1:10:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.82,1:11:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有效 它们找不到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked. They can't find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.57,1:11:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.90,1:11:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得制造噪音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}make some noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.84,1:11:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多噪音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of noise!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.28,1:11:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你这混蛋 回来抓我啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sorry sons of bitches. Come and get my ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.68,1:11:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 黏答答的怪物 来抓我啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, you slime bucket! Come get me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.93,1:11:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 你怕了吗？快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, scared? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.92,1:11:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 她在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.49,1:12:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 好女孩 真是聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That did it, girl! Goddamn good thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.98,1:13:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？ - 还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.89,1:13:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.83,1:14:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接着 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.58,1:14:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.49,1:14:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,装甲车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armored transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.29,1:14:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 海瑟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, Heather!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.86,1:14:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.36,1:14:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 海瑟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, Heather!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.46,1:14:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩快点 我们要到山区去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go, you two. We're headed for the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.36,1:14:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是这样的话 我们得有所准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's how we're doing it, we're going prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.03,1:14:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们撑不了多久的 那些家伙很聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't hold still long. These things are damn smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.60,1:14:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们愈来愈聪明 - 没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're getting smarter by the minute. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.27,1:14:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也有新玩意要来教训它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got some new things to teach them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.36,1:14:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.02,1:15:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们又来了 每次我一停 它们就这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're doing it again. They try it every time we stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.96,1:15:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.63,1:15:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 我们只要走14 15公里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ! We're only going nine miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.07,1:15:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些家伙会跟着我们屁股走 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things will be on our ass every foot of the way, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.67,1:15:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 柏特 - 海瑟 你们到底在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just hurry! - What are you doing up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.07,1:15:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没看到我们正往下沉吗？ - 快上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't you see we are sinking. - Get in the trailer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.54,1:15:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢火力大的还是这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think? Max firepower or this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.60,1:15:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,遣枝点458口径的 能射穿固体 也不用带太多弹药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go for penetration. The.458, shooting solids. Less ammo to carry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.92,1:15:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 柏特 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.59,1:15:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心这些弹药盒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch these ammo boxes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.75,1:15:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 柏特 - 快啊 海瑟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Burt! - Heather, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.56,1:15:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫他们快点 - 好了 下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell them to come on! - Okay, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.26,1:15:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来 快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我枪 我要干掉一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a gun. I'll take one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.94,1:15:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是第三次世界大战 我也不会给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't give you a gun if it was World War III.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.72,1:16:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 五年的存粮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food for five years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.29,1:16:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千加仑的水 空气过滤器 净水器 盖氏计算器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1, 000 gallons of gas, air and water filtration, Geiger counter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.70,1:16:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,防空避难所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bomb shelter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.27,1:16:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死得地底怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underground. Goddamn monsters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.55,1:16:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了 坚硬的岩石区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go! Fallen Rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.76,1:16:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有它们得踪迹吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.57,1:16:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许它们已经放弃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they just gave up, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.00,1:16:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.48,1:17:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 它们在搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! What the hell are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.14,1:17:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要不在这里捣乱 才不管它们搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what they're doing as long as they're doing it way over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.29,1:17:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.33,1:17:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.46,1:17:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈咪 - 大家留在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy! Mommy! - Eveybody stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.50,1:17:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柏特 你还好吗？ - 我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burt, you okay? - I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.37,1:17:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们要来抓我们吗？怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they going to get us? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.54,1:17:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柏特 你真的没事？ - 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burt, you sure you're okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.51,1:17:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厄尔 怎么回事？ - 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.38,1:17:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们挖了一个陷阱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They dug a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.38,1:17:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.82,1:17:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.05,1:17:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.53,1:17:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一把枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me have my gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.67,1:18:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿了吗？吃这个吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry? Eat this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.81,1:18:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.92,1:18:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.59,1:18:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀掉了吗？ - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you kill one? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.89,1:18:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里还有两只 有两个不同的泥土痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's still two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.68,1:18:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯定让它们不敢轻举妄动 - 三思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There're two different dust trails. - Made them think twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.10,1:18:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意 柏特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.53,1:18:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些照比例混合的家用化学粉末{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few household chemicals in the proper proportion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.37,1:18:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了 它们回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come. They're coming back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.22,1:18:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得跑到那些石头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to make a run for those rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.59,1:18:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 小瓦 那太远了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. That's a long way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.52,1:18:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被抓到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll get us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.79,1:18:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,若留在这里 一定会被抓到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to get us if we stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.29,1:18:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 柏特 还有更多炸弹吗？ - 够你用的 兰达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have any more of those bombs? - We've got you covered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.06,1:19:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果朝我们要跑的方向丢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we throw one that way, the way we want to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.36,1:19:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么它一爆炸 它们就会跑走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when it explodes I mean if it drives them away, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.93,1:19:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就他妈得拼命跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we run like goddamn bastards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.97,1:19:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉说粗话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon my French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.61,1:19:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它们不怕 反而没跑呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they don't get scared? What if they don't run?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.41,1:19:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为它们会被吓跑的 炸弹伤过它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it does scare them. It hurts them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.81,1:19:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们对声音很敏感 一定会跑开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're sensitive to sound, they'll run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.11,1:19:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投她一票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, she's got my vote!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.95,1:19:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们就放手一搏吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! We're making a run for it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.62,1:19:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朝石头那儿跑 - 我不知道 它们动作太快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're going for the rocks. - I don't know. They're too fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.99,1:19:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝不可能跑得过它们的 - 马文 这能吓走它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't out run them. No way! - This'll make them think twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.59,1:19:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody ready to run?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.64,1:19:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.81,1:19:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了 它们走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked! There they go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.98,1:19:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.68,1:19:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right - let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.19,1:19:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 柏特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.36,1:20:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 柏特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Burt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.96,1:20:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 你这混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Burt You asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.80,1:20:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agh! Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.97,1:20:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.88,1:20:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快上来 - 我在你后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up here! - I'm with you, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.02,1:20:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.46,1:20:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特 你这混蛋 枪里没子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asshole! There are no bullets in this gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.23,1:20:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你跑了 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you moving, didn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.69,1:21:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.10,1:21:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以用柏特的炸弹 一路跑到山区里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we make it to the mountains? Use Burt's explosives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.60,1:21:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.57,1:21:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那需要50颗才行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd need 50 of those bombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.74,1:21:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.24,1:21:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法离开这石头了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not getting off this rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.15,1:21:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能用撑竿跳离开这里 这点绝对是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to pole vault out of here. That's for damn sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.68,1:21:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.52,1:21:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.38,1:21:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像已经放弃了一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you're giving up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.42,1:21:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会等到我们挂了 那是它们的习惯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll wait out there untill we're dead. That's exactly what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.72,1:21:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.89,1:21:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上 待在家里还有水 食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Chrissake, we could've made a stand at our place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.46,1:21:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以和它对抗 - 那样是没法和它们打的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We had food, water… - You can't fight them like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.70,1:21:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们俩把我们拖来这里又能怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you two screw-ups hauled us way the hell out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.62,1:21:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不退一步想想 瘦竹竿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just back off, string bean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.03,1:22:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真该把你留在屋顶不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could've left your ass on the roof!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.11,1:22:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你做了 无能的领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you had, fearless leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.81,1:22:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁让你们俩当领导的？ - 别逼我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who put you two in charge? - Don't push me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.98,1:22:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别他妈的逼我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't push me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.22,1:22:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只怪物不杀他 我也会杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If them graboids don't kill him, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.49,1:22:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.43,1:22:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在半小时内 就会把你们的房子拆得粉碎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd have torn up your place in half an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.13,1:22:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 算了 别再想了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Just let it go. Forget about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.00,1:22:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他自以为是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he does. He thinks he knows everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.25,1:22:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当快饿死时 我知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it comes to starvation, I know what I'm doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.62,1:22:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take one of these…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.92,1:22:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,点燃它走出去 让它们把我吃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}walk right out there with the fuse lit and let them take me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.53,1:22:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.53,1:22:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Lord, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.97,1:23:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点子还不赖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's not a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.21,1:23:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我想起一个方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It gives me an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.64,1:23:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going fishing like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.98,1:23:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,正前方有一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one. Straight out in front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.72,1:23:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能不能让它留在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if we can keep him right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.15,1:23:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要多久时间？ - 不知道 它们动作很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much we need? - I don't know. They're pretty quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.22,1:23:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少15秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen seconds at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.16,1:23:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么导火线？ - 大炮引线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which kind of fuse is that? - Cannon fuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.03,1:23:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你用它来做什么？ - 引爆大炮啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell you use if for? - My cannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.33,1:23:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们自己小心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys watch yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.64,1:23:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里大约30{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right out there, about 30…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.97,1:23:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 你不会要表演套绳索吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going do your lasso thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.41,1:23:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不会套绳索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you're no good with a rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.02,1:23:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.49,1:23:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.26,1:24:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬住它 咬住诱饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it. Take the bait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.04,1:24:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.44,1:24:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看它 - 耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at it! - yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.42,1:24:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.63,1:24:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 只剩一只了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, one to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.94,1:24:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 它在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! Where the hell is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.24,1:24:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它不是太聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope he didn't wise up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.81,1:24:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.98,1:24:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.78,1:24:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.78,1:24:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只畜牲是我的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This son of a bitch is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.26,1:24:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it goes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.99,1:25:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 退后 - 知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, get back! - I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.23,1:25:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.34,1:25:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 午餐时间到了 猪头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Lunchtime, slophead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.45,1:25:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.85,1:25:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.52,1:25:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天 这是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! It's coming…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.16,1:25:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退回去 退回去 - 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back! - Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.86,1:25:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.71,1:25:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在那儿干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.06,1:26:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制造一些噪音 分散它的注意力 快点 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's make some noise. Try to distract them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.38,1:26:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲜肉在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh meat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.53,1:26:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.70,1:26:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只竟然没上当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's not falling for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.90,1:26:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one ain't dumb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.71,1:26:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想骗我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to trick us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.74,1:27:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.75,1:27:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一颗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.22,1:27:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能用在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else you going use it for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.39,1:27:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算跑到石头区又能怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if we make it to the rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.72,1:27:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正三天后也是死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be dead in three days anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.02,1:27:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我想多活三天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to live for the three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.39,1:27:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.39,1:27:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看在上帝份上 丢炸弹吧 - 丢炸弹 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Use the bomb, for God's sake! - Throw that bomb, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.80,1:27:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它吓跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scare them away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.63,1:27:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快丢炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw the bomb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.14,1:27:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只畜牲不会比我们聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bastard ain't smarter than us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.71,1:27:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝份上 小瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Chrissake, Val!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.64,1:27:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to go for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.15,1:27:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.93,1:27:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要干嘛？ - 我有个计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I got a goddamn plan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.67,1:27:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,打火机呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.24,1:28:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.11,1:28:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这最好是个很棒的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better be one hell of a great plan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.26,1:28:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.59,1:28:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 点燃它 点燃它 - 还没到时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Light it, man! - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.03,1:28:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 你在等什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. What are you waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.00,1:28:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.37,1:28:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.14,1:28:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太远了 你丢到它后面去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too far! You threw it behind him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.31,1:28:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瓦 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Val{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.99,1:28:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会飞吗 笨蛋？你会飞吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fly, you sucker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.21,1:29:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是突然想到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just suddenly hit me, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.89,1:29:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛群狂奔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stampede.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.76,1:29:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to go, Val! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.73,1:29:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 小瓦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to go, Val! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.24,1:29:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一到毕斯比 就开始打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…the second we hit Bixby, we start making phone calls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.28,1:29:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事能让我们赚点钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could make some real money on this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.78,1:29:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会登上People杂志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could get in People magazine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.45,1:29:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,People杂志？是National Geographic杂志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People? Hell! National Geographic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.72,1:30:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.56,1:30:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.47,1:30:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏特借我照相机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt loaned me his camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.61,1:30:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哦 他也给了我们这些轮胎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He gave us these tires, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.05,1:30:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够刺激吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all pretty exciting, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.15,1:30:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一定会成立一个研究小组 我会是其中一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's going to be research, and I'm going to be in on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.66,1:30:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先要帮那只怪物多拍几张照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first thing to do is take pictures of that one we dug up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.06,1:30:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.96,1:30:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,照相是个好点子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pictures seem like a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.90,1:30:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你所做的一切 救了我一命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything. Saving my life and stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.51,1:30:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.31,1:30:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许将来会再见到你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll see you sometime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.99,1:31:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 再见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}well. See you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.37,1:31:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 我正要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know! I know. I'm working up to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.34,1:31:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.84,1:31:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,像她这样的女人怎会看上我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a woman like her want with a guy like me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.01,1:31:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会当她的博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going for her damn Ph.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.11,1:31:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰达？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhonda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.18,1:31:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.45,1:31:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to…{\r}
